                        "review": "Playing in 2026 on a Vive Pro 2.  What can I say, but I like it.  Looks real good.  Cute characters with natural dialogue.  I had a tough time in figuring out if what I spent so much time doing was even a puzzle (stacking blocks is not a puzzle).  I enjoyed the story and acting, and it’s a shame that it ends abruptly with no chance of an episode 3 to finish it.  I paid full price and didn’t really mind buying e1 and e2 in a bundle.  I still spent probably 6-7 hours between the two.  Don’t hesitate if you see it on sale.  It’s still good.",
